1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:03,298
“Came alone? Log
kya kahenge, beta?”

2
00:00:03,358 --> 00:00:07,758
Chhoti Diwali puja. Tara's divorce
was three months ago…

3
00:00:07,758 --> 00:00:09,887
and the whole room went quiet.

4
00:00:09,887 --> 00:00:14,160
Everyone remembers the Narak
Chaturdashi story… Narakasura's
defeat.

5
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:16,570
But the Bhagavata Purana tells
what came after…

6
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:20,493
in his palace, 16,100 princesses
were held captive.

7
00:00:20,493 --> 00:00:23,374
Tara is silent… Bua's
words hang in the air.

8
00:00:23,374 --> 00:00:26,940
People remember the firecrackers…
the text, what came next.

9
00:00:26,940 --> 00:00:34,563
“He sent them to Dwarka, in
spotless clothes, in palanquins,

10
00:00:34,563 --> 00:00:39,655
with treasure.” Then
he married them.

11
00:00:39,655 --> 00:00:41,565
Dignity isn't lost
because of a story…

12
00:00:41,565 --> 00:00:45,619
the family decides whether to give
it, in front of everyone.

13
00:00:45,849 --> 00:00:47,069
Then Dadi stood up…

14
00:00:47,069 --> 00:00:50,809
took Tara's hand, and had Tara
light the first diya.

15
00:00:50,839 --> 00:00:53,962
If you were there… would you stay
quiet, or be the Dadi?
